Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/hatlabs/halos-halpi2-desktop
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: halos-halpi2-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         halos-halpi2,
         halos-desktop,
         halos-halpi-desktop-branding
Description: HALPI2 desktop variant metapackage
 This metapackage marks a HaLOS installation as a HALPI2 desktop variant
 and pins the HALPI2-branded wallpaper as the resolved provider of the
 virtual halos-desktop-wallpaper. Pulled in by halos-halpi2's Recommends
 on HALPI2 hardware; its Depends triple is the gating filter, so it is
 silently skipped on HALPI2 headless installations where halos-desktop
 is not present.
 .
 Future HALPI2-only desktop content (login screen branding, terminal
 palette, panel theming) will be added as dependencies here.
